      "Does moving into a higher tax bracket reduce my net take-home pay?": "No. Higher brackets only apply to dollars earned above each threshold. A pay raise always increases your take-home pay.",
      "What is the average effective federal tax rate for Americans?": "According to IRS SOI data, the overall average effective federal tax rate is ~13.6%, with middle earners paying ~8% to 11%.",
