      "title": "Educational & Regulatory Disclaimer",
      "text": "This calculator computes state income tax estimates based on published statutory brackets from state departments of revenue. It does not calculate county surcharges, city wage taxes, or state-specific credits. Consult a licensed CPA for multi-state filings."
