      "text": "This calculator computes self-employment tax estimates under IRS Code Section 1401 and 1402. Calculations do not include local gross receipts taxes, self-employed health insurance deductions, or Solo 401(k) profit-sharing write-offs. Consult a CPA for business tax planning."
