      "html": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n  <a href=\"/blogs/us-self-employment-tax-1099-schedule-c-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Freelancer Guide</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">US 1099 Self-Employment Tax Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Schedule C expense write-offs, home office deductions, and SE tax calculations.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/corporate-tax/business-entities/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\">Entity Choice</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">LLC vs S-Corp vs C-Corp Comparison</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">How legal entity structure dictates liability protection, payroll, and overall tax burden.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/payroll-tax/se-tax-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\">Payroll Strategy</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">S-Corp Payroll &amp; Reasonable Salary</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">IRS audit criteria for setting shareholder-employee wages vs tax-free distributions.</p>\n  </a>\n</div>"
