      "html": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/irs-support/where-is-my-refund/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Refund Guide</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Where's My Refund Complete IRS Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Detailed explanation of IRS tracker status codes, direct deposit schedules, and PATH Act holds.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/irs-support/irs-phone-numbers/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\">Direct Support</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">IRS Phone Numbers Directory</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Official phone lines for individual filers, amended returns, and taxpayer advocates.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/income-tax/how-to-file/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\">Form 1040</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">How to File Form 1040 Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Step-by-step instructions for electronic filing, direct deposit setup, and extension requests.</p>\n  </a>\n</div>"
