      "html": "<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n  <a href=\"/blogs/dave-ramsey-roth-ira-vs-401k-order/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Investing Order</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Roth IRA vs 401(k) Order of Investing</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Optimal sequence: capture employer match first, max Roth IRA, then max 401(k).</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/countries/united-states/tax-planning/year-round-tax-planning/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\">Year-Round Planning</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">Year-Round Tax Planning Strategies</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Charitable bunching, HSA triple-tax advantages, and tax loss harvesting.</p>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/blogs/us-federal-income-tax-brackets-2026-guide/\" class=\"block rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-4 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\">Tax Brackets</span>\n    <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary mt-1\">US Federal Income Tax Brackets Guide</h3>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">Understand the 10% to 37% tax brackets and how deductions lower your marginal tier.</p>\n  </a>\n</div>"
